\newlabel{fig:ch4_oneweb_like_geometry}{{3}{3}{Illustrative beam-role identification result in the OneWeb-like local geometry. Satellites S2, S5, and S8 are critical satellites, while S1, S3, S4, S6, S7, and S9 are helper satellites. The hatched regions indicate closed beams on the critical satellites}{figure.3}{}}
